This product embeds the EFF Large Wordlist for passphrases
(assets/eff_large_wordlist.txt), published by the Electronic Frontier Foundation
(https://www.eff.org/files/2016/07/18/eff_large_wordlist.txt) and licensed under the
Creative Commons Attribution 4.0 International License (CC BY 4.0) under EFF's
copyright policy (https://www.eff.org/copyright). The server and the CLI embed it, and
the browser fetches it from the server, to generate passphrases.

The release archives and the container image also ship THIRD-PARTY-NOTICES.txt, with
the license texts of every Rust crate linked into each binary.
